   "cooked": "<p>Hi again everyone!</p>\n<p>Wanted to give a quick update. We schedule a recurring meeting every other Friday at 19:00 UTC. The meeting was included on 1Hive’s calendar under the Luna Swarm <img alt=\":first_quarter_moon_with_face:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/first_quarter_moon_with_face.png?v=10\" title=\":first_quarter_moon_with_face:\"/> event:</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://wiki.1hive.org/getting-started/calendar\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://wiki.1hive.org/getting-started/calendar\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">wiki.1hive.org</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" height=\"362\" src=\"https://app.gitbook.com/share/space/thumbnail/-MNrqwoYUmro4mJ9smmt-887967055.png?color=%23ED811D&amp;logo=https%3A%2F%2F3994131263-files.gitbook.io%2F~%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-legacy-files%2Fo%2Fspaces%252F-MNrqwoYUmro4mJ9smmt%252Favatar-rectangle-1628787859023.png%3Fgeneration%3D1628787859287398%26alt%3Dmedia&amp;theme=light\" width=\"690\"/></div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://wiki.1hive.org/getting-started/calendar\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Calendar</a></h3>\n<p>1Hive Google calendar for all upcoming events.</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p>Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/K63jqAdcRc\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">#cafe channel of 1Hive’s Discord server</a>! <img alt=\":raised_hands:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/raised_hands.png?v=10\" title=\":raised_hands:\"/></p>",
